{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1369227-any-video-game-suggestions-for-aeon-inspiration","id":1369227,"title":"Any video game suggestions for Aeon inspiration?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-20T16:28:13-08:00","id":1369227,"title":"Any video game suggestions for Aeon inspiration?","content":"Hello all, I was just wondering if anyone had any video game suggestions to inspire some ideas for Aeon? I have already played the hell out of Mass Effect 1-3, and Andromeda so something else is in order.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-20T21:31:53-08:00","id":1369277,"title":"","content":"Honestly, the entire Halo backstory has been giving me plenty of ideas; not only does it have future combat with plenty of Aeon inspiration, the whole &quot;secret history of the Galaxy&quot; trope it has could be super relatable. <br /> Sorry for the run-on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25900-tritoninvestigator","name":"Tritoninvestigator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-20T23:37:21-08:00","id":1369285,"title":"","content":"Deus Ex, and sequels, for general atmosphere and possibly Nihonjin Superiors. Dead Space, Prey, and sequels, for Aberrant anta